VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p385-15', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 385, 'Discussion: If a data source contains personally identifiable information but the information will not be used, the dataset can be de-identified when it is created by not collecting the', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p385-15', 0, 29, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', 'C9DC19C2D89BE49FCECCCEC79C9C8C295D5B44F10FEF5E87BD579DB28303566E', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
