VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p388-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 388, 'packets it includes potentially contain malicious code, and that the unauthorized entity may have potentially obtained a copy of the database. Another tainting approach can include embedding false data or steganographic data in files to enable the data to be found via open-source analysis.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p388-2', 0, 44, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '9DB62446F378D0D57CB7F1E604DD136DA8D734915A91FBC7DB5BE8033BD77D3A', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
