VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p389-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 389, 'a. Fragment the following information: [Assignment: organization-defined information]; and b. Distribute the fragmented information across the following systems or system components: [Assignment organization-defined systems or system components].', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p389-2', 0, 27, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '54655D6F6E3999A4524A64DBC5889AD120B4004F0C3FB51165850CC2D9A7784B', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
