VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p394-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 394, 'and document any changes to the provenance, including changes in supply chain elements or configuration, and help ensure non-repudiation of provenance information and the provenance change records. Provenance considerations are addressed throughout the system development life cycle and incorporated into contracts and other arrangements, as appropriate.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p394-2', 0, 46, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', 'DA25C23A26D4E96C12920D58BC617A40259D05C3677831D64475C0BA128EF3B4', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
