VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p430-7', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 430, 'FIPS-validated cryptography A cryptographic module validated by the Cryptographic Module Validation Program (CMVP) to meet requirements specified in FIPS Publication 140-3 (as amended). As a prerequisite to CMVP validation, the cryptographic module is required to employ a cryptographic algorithm implementation that has successfully passed validation testing by the Cryptographic Algorithm Validation Program (CAVP). See NSA-approved cryptography.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p430-7', 0, 56, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', 'E411E381F188178D79EEB910D4A76D495EF827332D4421F9ABD6271DCEF40111', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
